        "divine",
        "emotion",
        "fear",
        "mental"
      ],
      "text": "Tollvych laments his fate, forcing each living creature within 30 feet to attempt a DC 36 Will save save.\n\nOn a failure, a creature becomes Frightened 2 (or Frightened 3 on a critical failure). On a success, a creature is temporarily immune to this Tollvych's frightful moan for 1 minute."
